                                "sense_id": "35ec9507-ed24-38a7-a300-f97633e7b100",
                                "text": "Inſtead of Home-ſpun quoifs were ſeen / Good Pinners, edg'd with Colberteen: [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96b0acae-7725-40cd-b3fd-9b1d547fcda8",
                                "sense_id": "35ec9507-ed24-38a7-a300-f97633e7b100",
                                "text": "If by the dairy's hatch I chance to hie, / I ſhall her goodly countenance eſpie, / For there her goodly countenance I've ſeen, / Set off with kerchief ſtarch'd and pinners clean."
